he leader on the same stores, real client Apply, real transport partition and real healing; the only addition is a VerifyLeader call on the stale leader between the client write and the old side's election.\\\",\n \\\"prerequisites\\\":[\n  {\\\"alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_truncation2\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"silent_change\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"committed\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"entry_type_at_x\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"LogConfiguration\\\"}]},\n  {\\\"alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_fsm\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"client_write\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"write_applied\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True}]},\n  {\\\"alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_verify\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"stale_verify_pre\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"a_is_leader\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True}]}\n ],\n \\\"comparisons\\\":[\n  {\\\"event\\\":\\\"after_heal\\\",\\\"identity_fields\\\":[\\\"x_index\\\"],\\\"admission_alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_truncation2\\\",\n   \\\"assertion\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"committed_entry_truncated\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":False},\n   \\\"description\\\":\\\"An entry committed under the configuration recorded in the logs must not be replaced after the partition heals.\\\"},\n  {\\\"event\\\":\\\"after_heal\\\",\\\"identity_fields\\\":[\\\"x_index\\\"],\\\"admission_alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_fsm\\\",\n   \\\"assertion\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"fsm_logs_equal\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True},\n   \\\"description\\\":\\\"After a client write returns success, every node following the same log must apply the same committed commands.\\\"},\n  {\\\"event\\\":\\\"stale_verify\\\",\\\"identity_fields\\\":[\\\"x_index\\\"],\\\"admission_alias\\\":\\\"admit_dual_verify\\\",\n   \\\"assertion\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"verify_confirmed_while_other_leader\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":False},\n   \\\"description\\\":\\\"A node must not confirm leadership for a client while a different majority of the committed configuration has elected a leader in a higher term.\\\"}\n ]\n}\nd['experiment']=exp\njson.dump(d, open(p,'w'), indent=2)\nEOF\ncd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-14_09-22-37-hashicorp_raft-real-run; /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run . --submission update.json 2>&1 | head -3\"","aggregated_output":"{\"valid\": false, \"run_id\": \"af7ab1df563f4f5686eb47935464cf57\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 2412.303597721, \"diagnostics\": [{\"details\": {}, \"code\": \"submission\", \"category\": \"semantic\", \"task\": \"\", \"candidate_version\": 0, \"object_ids\": [], \"paths\": [], \"material_ids\": [], \"message\": \"Revise the current successor, not a retired predecessor\", \"allowed\": []}], \"meaning\": \"Read-only validation of these bytes and saved state; no acceptance, execution or budget reservation\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
